WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:04.350
Keep your schedule open three days from now.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.870
-Why?
-That day...

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.110
Well, it marks one month since we started dating.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.880
Why keep count?

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.090
In the end, we'll either split up or stay together.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:19.090
That's cold! But for us,
our lives are on the line every day!

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:22.680
So, going a month without being found out--

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.460
Well...

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.960
I wanted to celebrate together.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.850
-Why did you laugh?
-No reason.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.650
I don't think you're a maiden on the inside or anything.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.720
You're such a bully!

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.450
What to do about this?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.850
I'm quite busy, you know.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.980
Fine, then I'll celebrate on my own.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.730
You're pouting. I guess it can't be helped.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.990
I'll keep my schedule open three days from now.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.740
That's a promise.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:10.080
-Inuzuka! Big trouble!
-Lady Persia! There's an urgent matter!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.310
I see, you were fighting with Inuzuka!

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:13.840
Let Hasuki lend a hand.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.340
More importantly, what's this urgent matter?

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.980
-Right!
-Right!

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:19.800
She who was absent for home affairs--

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.600
The violent princess of the West.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.950
It's been a year since you were at this school,
hasn't it, Princess Char?

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.330
Stop the car, Sebas.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.320
But we haven't arrived at the school yet.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.820
It's fine. Let me out here.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.320
Now, go inform them.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:38.640
Chartreux Westia
First Princess of the West

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:42.960
They are to be ready to greet me within three minutes.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.580
Chartreux Westia
First Princess of the West

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.000
That's Char's request.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:21.810
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:30.660
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:36.660
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:42.000
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:47.170
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.930
So that I can protect you

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:56.430
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:01.980
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:07.030
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:13.990
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.000
Big news!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.960
Romio and Princess Char
Big news!

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.970
Princess Char has returned to school!
Romio and Princess Char

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.590
Hurry, we're going to meet her!

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.220
Lay out the red carpet!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:27.720
Welcome back, Lady Char!

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.280
Lady Char!

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.610
-Oh, Scott. Long time no see.
-Yes.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.370
Hey, tell a joke.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.320
If it's boring...

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.570
-I'll hit you!
-What?

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:44.160
-It's Char's request.
-Yes!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:48.510
I, Scott, unworthy as I am, will tell a joke!

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:50.790
My glasses in space--

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.560
I wasn't finished.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:57.270
-Your whole existence is boring, so I hit you anyway.
-That's horrible!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:02.430
I see you haven't changed,
Tyrant Princess of the West.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:05.050
It's good to see you, Princess Char.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.810
My, if it isn't Persia.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.310
You're as doll-like as ever.

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.440
Princess Char, my hair...

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.460
Oh, my apologies.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:25.950
More importantly, I said for everyone to greet me.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:29.080
Where's my welcome from the Black Doggies?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.680
Think we care? We're not on your retainer.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.330
We won't be ordered around by you.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:40.710
Oh, but you will, especially you, Inuzuka.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.320
That's interesting.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.220
Just how are you going to make me listen?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.520
Tell me!

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.890
-Princess Char!
-Inuzuka!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:56.150
You're dating Persia, right?

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.530
Inuzuka stopped?

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.180
Quit making stuff up.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.540
I even know about the trick with the boy's uniform.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.510
How do you--?

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.500
I mean-- What are you talking about?

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.750
I took a picture too.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:23.920
Want to see?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:27.140
She got me!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:30.430
-Inuzuka!
-What's come over you?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.560
Impressive, Princess Char.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.780
What did she do?

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:39.060
It looked like Char flashed her chest for a second.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:43.410
We've been found out.
We've been found out, we've been found out!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:46.450
At this rate, we'll split up.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.840
Don't you worry.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.760
If you agree to my terms, I'll keep quiet.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.580
Terms?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:57.680
You'll have to become my faithful hound.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:01.520
-Got it?
-Hound? You're kidding.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.590
I'm the leader of the Black Doggies!
I'd rather die than be--

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.840
My shoulders are a little stiff.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.850
You've made the right choice.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.720
Hey, that hurts! Be gentle.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.230
What am I...?

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:22.980
Persia is looking at me like I'm a dust rag
that hasn't been washed in a week.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:26.240
Stop it! Open your eyes!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.340
He's the worst. That's the enemy's princess.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.240
How could he be ensnared by her chest?

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.260
No matter how big her boobs are.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.010
And they are big.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.000
Big indeed.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.590
It's not over yet.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:43.000
I'll corner you even further.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:50.220
Got it? No matter where you are,
you'd better come by the third time I blow this whistle.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.200
Understood?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.470
I guess I'll go expose that picture--

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:00.740
Please! Can't you overlook this?

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.610
What is that pose?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:07.120
I'm begging you. Right now,
I know Touwa and the West don't get along.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.740
I don't care about that.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:15.120
I'd always wanted one,
a faithful Black Doggy hound.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:20.120
Do the two of you realize
the impact your deception could have?

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:26.880
If you're found out, you'd lose your campus team
and popularity for sure.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.760
If that happened...

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:37.530
The strength I'm aiming for
is strong enough to change even the world.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.980
Persia won't be able to make her dream come true.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.570
So, you've got no choice but to obey me.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:48.820
This will be our little secret.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.210
What should I do now?

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:56.330
-Inuzuka.
-Persi--

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.080
What is it, all of a sudden?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:03.560
That's what I want to know.
What were you doing alone with Princess Char?

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.060
That was...

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:10.050
It's not that I mind what you're doing
and with whom.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:13.860
It's just, the way you looked at her was suspicious.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.430
Do you prefer larger ones like hers?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.220
You're misunderstanding something!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.450
What was that sound?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.740
I have to go.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:25.060
Wait, where are you going?

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.070
Sorry, wait here for a bit.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.820
Come on, what's this about?

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.570
Goodness, you were slow.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:36.170
Now, hurry up. Take me to my dorm.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.080
It's Char's request.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.580
Wait! I think carrying you piggy-back
would be faster than on all fours.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.350
That's no good! A dog has to act dog-like.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.830
I want to hit her!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.090
-I'll give you a bone if you put your back into it.
-Like I'd want that!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.800
A picture, then?

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.780
What happened to Inuzuka?

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.310
I misjudged him.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.200
Has Inuzuka betrayed us?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.940
What should we do, Maru?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:10.190
There's only one thing to do with traitors,
a good old lynching.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.840
He was in such a hurry. What happened?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.570
Persia!

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.700
-Sorry to keep you!
-Seriously, what happened?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.950
Crap, I'm still in dog-mode.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.180
There's a reason for this.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:26.960
-What reason?
-It's...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:28.630
I feel like eating deer.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.540
Char's Request
I feel like eating deer.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.720
Go catch one!
There are some in the forest nearby.
Char's Request

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.600
Inuzuka sure is taking a while.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.850
Sorry about that.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.730
I got a little caught up.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.980
Where did those deer--? Inuzuka!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.730
-This is--
-Again?

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:55.290
That girl's enjoying this.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.740
At this rate, our anniversary...

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.920
Does that whistle have something to do with you?

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.620
Give me an explanation, already.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:09.000
I can't say. But I will protect you without fail.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.130
So, for now...

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.230
You're undefeated.

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:23.850
Making a timid face like that isn't like you.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.580
Not like me?

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:28.940
-Crap.
-Go on!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.890
You have to get going, right?

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.190
But...

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.670
our anniversary can't be lonely, okay?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:43.660
Yeah!

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.290
Sorry!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.760
I just felt like calling you.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.290
I wanted to see my doggy's face.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:54.920
Are you mad?

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:59.840
Of course not. Your wish is my command.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:04.030
Inuzuka's her play-thing now.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:07.160
Guess that means the Black Doggies are finished.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.450
Say what you will.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:13.480
I have to be submissive for now,
and find her weakness!

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:16.480
I have to settle this in three days, before our anniversary.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:21.920
I'll make sure I pay you back with blackmail,
just like you blackmailed me!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:28.750
What's the deal, you guys?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.350
There's no deal.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:35.750
Why would a servant of the White Cats, like you,
get to enter the Black Doggies' dorm?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:41.130
-Screw you! Where am I supposed to--?
-Find a barn or something, you White Cat lapdog.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:45.320
-Normally, you'd be lynched without question.
-That's right.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:48.520
-Be grateful to Hasuki.
-Hasuki?

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.330
Inuzuka wouldn't betray Touwa!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:55.580
I'm sure they've just found a weakness of his!
That's what I think!

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:58.150
She desperately protected you.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.630
I'll overlook this out of respect for Hasuki.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:06.910
But if I find out you've actually betrayed us,
I won't go easy on you.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.550
Hasuki.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.190
Thank you.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.310
2 Days until the Anniversary

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.810
Put my shoes on for me.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.940
Feed me.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.400
I hate carrots.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.900
-Beat those guys up!
-That might be...

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.460
This selfish girl!

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:49.160
I'll cut off your bangs
and transplant them to your armpits!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:53.160
No, I have to stay calm.
Finding her weakness is my priority.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.670
But this girl...

00:12:58.180 --> 00:12:59.800
her head's clear.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.180
Her physical ability is exceptional.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.190
She keeps up appearances, so the teachers like her too.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.140
She has no weak points!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.780
So, she's not just a princess for show.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:15.560
Faster, doggy!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.200
She's got plenty of people who'd do her bidding.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.750
Why only me?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.570
I'll be late for dinner.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.580
She's enjoying tormenting me.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.950
Come now, hurry it up.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.950
Actually, turn around.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.340
My head's not a handle!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:38.590
-I don't care, just turn around.
-What about dinner?

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:41.100
-Hurry!
-What's your problem?

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:44.470
Thanks to you, Persia,
I think I'll be able to pass this test.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.590
If there's anything else you don't understand,

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.600
-feel free to ask me.
-Okay. Thank you.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.100
-Don't look at me!
-We'll try.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.610
I get to share a room with Princess Char again, I see.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.740
That's right.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.460
1 Day until the Anniversary

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.490
-Princess Char?
-Yeah.
1 Day until the Anniversary

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.800
-Princess Char?
-Yeah.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:14.620
If you know anything, could you tell me?

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.870
Why are you asking this all of a sudden?

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.680
It doesn't matter why, I just need to know.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.060
Princess Char is a childhood friend.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.650
A childhood friend?

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.390
Char, wait!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.390
Hurry up, Per!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:41.080
Since we were kids,
I've spent time with her as a chaperone, of sorts.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:46.650
But since she's returned, she's been somewhat cold.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:52.130
As soon as I start talking to Persia, that whistle blows.

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.490
Sorry, got to go.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.250
Persia?

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:01.520
It's only natural she'd be angry about it.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:04.000
Even Persia gets worried.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.760
If this keeps up we really will split up.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.880
I'll have to pull out all the stops.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:14.640
I have to settle this
before our anniversary tomorrow!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.640
Day of the Anniversary

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:23.150
Announcement from the principal.
Chartreux, please come to the principal's office.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.910
Time to search Char's room!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:35.540
The fake information I leaked
should keep her busy for a while.

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:40.140
During that time,
I have to find something to blackmail her with.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:43.380
If I'm lucky, I can steal that date photo.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:50.110
Honestly, sneaking into a princess' room?

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.140
You've got some guts.

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:57.890
Did you think I'd be fooled by a broadcast like that?

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.950
You've hidden yourself.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:05.230
So, you want to play hide-and-seek?

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:10.740
Then, when I find you, I'll have you
expelled for breaking and entering.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.910
Under the desk!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.220
Not here.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.660
Under the bed!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.770
Not here either.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.360
The only other place you could be hiding...

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.550
is the closet!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.240
Not here? But that would mean...

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:43.100
-It can't be!
-Man, I've found something spectacular.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:48.110
Who would've guessed the mirror was a secret door.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.740
-How did you...?
-Pure coincidence.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.140
Crap!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.870
Thinking it was a window...

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:59.240
I dove into the mirror by mistake.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.370
That impact opened the door.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.000
-And what I found inside was shocking.
-No!

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:14.010
You've been hiding a huge amount
of pictures of Persia!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:18.110
You're in love with Persia, aren't you?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.320
I don't know what you mean.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:22.990
Then I'll just take them all.

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:25.980
You can't! That's my collection!

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:32.830
What would Persia think
if she knew how many pictures you have of her? Well?

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.920
What would the White Cats think

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.870
if they knew their nation's princess
was taking secret photos?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.700
-Shut up!
-Your real goal was to get between Persia and me,

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.580
and make us break up!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:47.210
-You were jealous!
-Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.090
Don't talk like you understand my feelings!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:55.970
Persia has always been by my side.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:18:00.470
She listened to me, she was my friend.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:05.120
She's my most treasured person!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.200
And yet, she's with someone like you.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.480
I can't forgive that!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.800
Don't take her away.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.550
She's precious to me.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:27.170
This girl really loves Persia.

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.000
Princess Char?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.640
-Persia? Why?
-We share a room.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:35.010
-That's so risky!
-What does that mean?

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:38.510
If she comes in now, she'll see the photos.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.640
-I'm coming in.
-Just hold on!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.140
It's no use.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:48.650
I don't want Persia to find out about these feelings.

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.650
Buy some time.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.650
This is no time to break down!

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:56.650
-Is someone else here?
-Of course not!

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:04.340
I can't get in!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.700
What's the problem? Let's talk here!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:07.910
Something's going on.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.810
Nothing at all!
Even if there were something, it's nothing!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.420
What are you talking about?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:15.880
Sorry, I have some important plans.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.820
What?

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.260
No, it's nothing.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:32.330
These plans must be pretty important
for you to be making a face like that.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.660
What's this about, all of a sudden?

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:35.900
It's nothing.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:40.280
I just kind of felt like you wouldn't be coming back.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:46.040
What are you talking about?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:49.970
No matter what happens, I'll always be by your side.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:54.790
You're my best friend, Char.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:20:01.270
-I'm sorry! I called you Char out of habit.
-It's fine! You can call me that.

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.360
But...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.680
only you, because you're special to me

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.580
It's like we're back to the old days.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.440
You're right.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.660
-Oh, no, I'm going to be late!
-What?

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:19.250
I made a promise.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.070
I mean, plans.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.320
See you.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.410
So, how long do you plan to stay there?

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.560
You didn't steal from my collection, did you?

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.940
Why did you help me?

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.190
I've done so many awful things to you.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:46.180
-If you're found out, I won't be able to blackmail you.
-Right.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.740
Besides...

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:54.200
I know the pain of not being able to tell someone
you love them.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.750
Don't touch me like it's nothing!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:02.320
I'll tell you this now,
as long as she's dating you, Per is in danger.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.820
That's why I'll never approve of this.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:09.090
-You don't have a cute side.
-Of course not.

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:15.140
I'm the Tyrant Princess of the West,
Princess Char, after all.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:42.670
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:50.680
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:57.980
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:04.610
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:12.830
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:19.170
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:26.420
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:28.630
I want to support you

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:36.470
With everything I have

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:44.570
Until the world can one day change

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:51.890
Persia!

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:54.360
Sorry!

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:56.370
I ended up being pretty late.

00:22:56.910 --> 00:22:59.480
-It's okay.
-You're not mad?

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:04.830
-Something good happened.
-I see. So...

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:08.380
-What is it?
-I was asking about Char yesterday and...

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:11.750
-Well, that was--
-You don't have to worry about that.

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:14.990
I thought about it a lot since then.

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:19.000
You're at the age where you're interested in that stuff.

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:21.750
No, that's not what--

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:24.770
That rosary, how...?

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:28.380
How? I fixed it, isn't it obvious?

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:32.260
I wouldn't just throw it away.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:41.310
Hey, don't cry so loudly!
What will we do if someone hears you?

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:45.240
Well, I suppose I owe him.

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:47.440
I guess I'll leave them alone.

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:50.760
For today, that is.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:56.910
-Hey, Inuzuka, I can't find my prized Persia photo.
-Can't help you.

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.790
I don't have your picture of little Persia
smiling ear to ear in a flower field.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.210
That's the one. Do you want
to become my hound again?

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:03.510
Romio and Hasuki
That's the one. Do you want
to become my hound again?

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:05.300
Next time, Romio and Hasuki.
Romio and Hasuki

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:06.960
I can't bear feeling like this anymore!
Romio and Hasuki
